('monsters', 'family_caster_standoff_fraction', NULL, 0.8, 'multiplier', 'diablocraft-l5ge; docs/proposals/monster-families.md Part 3. How far a family monster with no melee swing stops from its target, as a fraction of its shortest direct reach (a bolt, volley, beam or trap): PLACEHOLDER 0.8 so a caster keeps its distance on dev; yours to set. 0 chases into melee. Read when a monster enters combat (.dc tunables set monsters family_caster_standoff_fraction <n> then .dc tunables reload)'),
