('monsters', 'family_speed_normal', 1.0, NULL, 'multiplier', 'diablocraft-uole; docs/proposals/monster-families.md 3.7 (b) (ruling q-1007-05); 13-elite-affixes section 5, RESOLVED 2026-09-08: a standard monster runs at 100% of the shared base run speed, as a ratio of speed_run (1.0 = the player''s unmodified base). The speed class of the roster word ''average'', and of every roster word that qualifies an ability instead of the run (''fast charge'', ''fast leap'', ''fast backward glide'', ''fast when burrowed'', ''flying/phase''): the burst belongs to the ability'),
