('paragon', 'allocate_gap_ms', NULL, 150.0, 'milliseconds', 'security.md G1 gaps; brief docs/briefs/claude-combat-g1-gaps-brief.md (ruling 2026-09-30) says start around 100-250; least time between two Paragon allocate or deallocate requests from one character - each waits for a database commit; 150 still lets a held button repeat about 6 times a second; 0 disables it'),
('paragon', 'core_only_after_level', 800.0, NULL, 'level', 'from character_rules.csv:name=paragon_core_only_after_level.value, mod-diablocraft/data/d3/paragon.csv row 20 (System / Point allocation) - "after Paragon 800 the Offensive/Defensive/Utility trees are maxed so all further points go to Core"; 10-paragon P2'),
('paragon', 'paragon_save_interval_ms', NULL, 10000.0, 'milliseconds', 'ruling 2026-10-09 (diablocraft-7f36; docs/decisions.md 2026-10-09). Most often the Paragon XP of an account is written to the database while it keeps changing; a kill only changes memory. A Paragon level-up, a rift''s closing XP, the last logout of the account, the creation floor and shutdown write at once. A server crash loses at most this much Paragon XP. 0 or blank writes at the next server tick'),
('paragon', 'respec_cooldown_ms', NULL, 1000.0, 'milliseconds', 'security.md G1; brief docs/briefs/claude-combat-security-fixes-brief.md (ruling 2026-09-30) says about 1 second; D3 respec is free so this is the only brake; 0 disables it.'),
